Installation on Linux
------------

Quick instructions:

1. copy the project to the intalation dir. For example:
cp -r cafes /opt/cafes/

2. open the projeto with Eclipse to compile the packages.
It will generate .class files in to the class subfolder

3. set the CAFES_HOME environment variable. For example:
export CAFES_HOME=/opt/cafes/

4. add cafes to the PATH
export PATH=$PATH:$CAFES_HOME/bin

5. run cafes
cafes.sh

